OL,3,AMyanmar committed genocide against
OL,4,ARohingya minority, top UN court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA military crackdown in 2017 killed
OL,7,Fthousands of Rohingya and forced more
OL,8,Fthan 700,000 to flee Buddhist-majority
OL,9,FMyanmar, formerly known as Burma.
OL,10,FMyanmar denied the claims against it,
OL,11,Fsaying its forces had responded to
OL,12,Fattacks by armed groups.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
