OL,3,ADozens missing after boat carrying
OL,4,Amigrants sinks off Senegal's coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenegalese authorities are continuing
OL,7,Fsearch operations after a boat said to
OL,8,Fbe carrying between 50 and 100 migrants
OL,9,Fcapsized in the Atlantic Ocean.
OL,11,FFour bodies have reportedly been
OL,12,Frecovered so far. Dozens of people are
OL,13,Fstill missing.
OL,15,FPersonal belongings were found on the
OL,16,Fbadly damaged boat, which washed ashore
OL,17,Fnear the village of Yenne, south of
OL,18,FDakar. Search operations continued
OL,19,Fthroughout Wednesday and were due to
OL,20,Fresume on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
